Niko is developed by Polik Warsoky and the people who sent changes to https://github.com/arngory/niko:
`git shortlog -s` lists every author of a commit.

Niko is a modified version of NekoBox for Android, by MatsuriDayo and its contributors:

https://github.com/MatsuriDayo/NekoBoxForAndroid/graphs/contributors

NekoBox for Android is based on SagerNet. SagerNet was originally created in late 2021, by
nekohasekai <contact-sagernet@sekai.icu>.

Here is an inevitably incomplete list of MUCH-APPRECIATED CONTRIBUTORS --
people who have submitted patches, fixed bugs, added translations, and
generally made SagerNet that much better:

https://github.com/SagerNet/SagerNet/graphs/contributors
